        "topic": "Financial Ratios",
        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2018",
        "question_text": "<p>The formula for calculating the <b>current ratio</b> is:</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The <i>Current Ratio</i> measures liquidity and is calculated as:<br><b>Current Ratio = Current Assets / Current Liabilities</b>.</p>",
